Continuing the screenplay (history at http://www.tassos-oak.com/tempp/ 
barsoomian.html), we finish the scene of the Princess on her air- 
yacht making a crucial decision:

.i. ai sirvoi ca'o lo li'i ma'a kakne .ijebabo ai cadzu

SUPER: Fly straight while we can. Then walk.

(intent) straight-fly during the-real experience-of we are-able; and- 
then (intent) walk

JARL THON

doi noltruti'u e'unai lei ri'opre ba kavbu do

SUPER: Princess! the Green Men will take you!

O Princess (warning) the mass-called green-persons will capture you

DEJAH THORIS

cumki fa le nu lo vinji pe ma'a cu me'imoi facki ma'a

SUPER: Our own ships may find us first.

possible-that: the event the-really ship of ours priorly finds us
(this line by la noras)

ko kurji lo pluta poi mi minde

SUPER: Set the course as I said

you-imperative attend to the course I order

The air-yacht accelerates away from us.
